{"nodes": [{"type": "file", "id": "331be895472d4147", "x": -100, "y": -188, "width": 200, "height": 150, "color": null, "file": "images/Pierre-Auguste Renoir, Le Moulin de la Galette.jpg", "subpath": null}, {"type": "text", "id": "953cff9faacb4d98", "x": -175, "y": -28, "width": 350, "height": 215, "color": "#f5c2e7", "text": "## impressionnisme\n\nL'impressionnisme est un mouvement pictural apparu en France dans les ann\u00e9es 1860 en opposition \u00e0 l'art acad\u00e9mique et visant \u00e0 repr\u00e9senter le caract\u00e8re \u00e9ph\u00e9m\u00e8re de la lumi\u00e8re et ses effets sur les cou..."}, {"type": "text", "id": "4538ead3e2c944fa", "x": 389, "y": -67, "width": 280, "height": 135, "color": "#cba6f7", "text": "**expressionnisme**\n\nL\u2019expressionnisme est un courant artistique figuratif apparu au d\u00e9but du XXe si\u00e8cle, en Europe du Nord et en Europe Centrale, particuli\u00e8rement en Allemagne."}, {"type": "file", "id": "c1d2e3c597674370", "x": 164, "y": 285, "width": 200, "height": 150, "color": null, "file": "images/Henri Rousseau (French) - A Centennial of Independence - Google Art Project.jpg", "subpath": null}, {"type": "text", "id": "beffee83967a48d5", "x": 124, "y": 445, "width": 280, "height": 185, "color": "#a6e3a1", "text": "**postimpressionnisme**\n\nLe postimpressionnisme, ou post-impressionnisme, caract\u00e9rise une p\u00e9riode de l'histoire de l'art moderne et de la peinture en particulier, entre la fin des ann\u00e9es 1880 et, par convention, l'ann\u00e9e 1910...."}, {"type": "text", "id": "2ebe30f52d724d54", "x": -404, "y": 390, "width": 280, "height": 135, "color": "#89dceb", "text": "**mouvement artistique**\n\nUn mouvement artistique ou courant artistique est un ensemble d'artistes et d'\u0153uvres artistiques ayant une esth\u00e9tique commune."}, {"type": "file", "id": "491905405a4246cc", "x": -629, "y": -134, "width": 200, "height": 150, "color": null, "file": "images/Van Gogh - Starry Night - Google Art Project.jpg", "subpath": null}, {"type": "text", "id": "3c459829cbcd49d5", "x": -669, "y": 26, "width": 280, "height": 110, "color": "#fab387", "text": "**genre artistique**\n\nforme d'art en termes de support, de format ou de th\u00e8me"}, {"type": "file", "id": "b4f7c4eb9d33407a", "x": -364, "y": -593, "width": 200, "height": 150, "color": null, "file": "images/Guiteau cartoon2.jpg", "subpath": null}, {"type": "text", "id": "1a2af56e6c41410d", "x": -404, "y": -433, "width": 280, "height": 110, "color": "#f9e2af", "text": "**style artistique**\n\ntype de style"}, {"type": "text", "id": "d73a952a02b44991", "x": 124, "y": -538, "width": 280, "height": 160, "color": "#f38ba8", "text": "**mouvement en peinture**\n\nUn mouvement est dans le domaine artistique, et dans la peinture en particulier, un style de peinture qui diff\u00e8re des autres soit pour des raisons esth\u00e9tiques, soit en fonction de la technique pictura..."}], "edges": [{"id": "db4a9b3998da4104", "fromNode": "953cff9faacb4d98", "fromSide": "right", "fromEnd": null, "toNode": "4538ead3e2c944fa", "toSide": "left", "toEnd": null, "color": "#f5c2e7", "label": "suit"}, {"id": "0bbb8c280e554c4c", "fromNode": "953cff9faacb4d98", "fromSide": "bottom", "fromEnd": null, "toNode": "beffee83967a48d5", "toSide": "top", "toEnd": null, "color": "#f5c2e7", "label": "suit"}, {"id": "bcbe3c41418c4bba", "fromNode": "953cff9faacb4d98", "fromSide": "bottom", "fromEnd": null, "toNode": "2ebe30f52d724d54", "toSide": "top", "toEnd": null, "color": "#f5c2e7", "label": "est un(e)"}, {"id": "a08ad8dadf3b49b6", "fromNode": "953cff9faacb4d98", "fromSide": "left", "fromEnd": null, "toNode": "3c459829cbcd49d5", "toSide": "right", "toEnd": null, "color": "#f5c2e7", "label": "est un(e)"}, {"id": "b4bd47fd490647fe", "fromNode": "953cff9faacb4d98", "fromSide": "top", "fromEnd": null, "toNode": "1a2af56e6c41410d", "toSide": "bottom", "toEnd": null, "color": "#f5c2e7", "label": "est un(e)"}, {"id": "8436863749c9414b", "fromNode": "953cff9faacb4d98", "fromSide": "top", "fromEnd": null, "toNode": "d73a952a02b44991", "toSide": "bottom", "toEnd": null, "color": "#f5c2e7", "label": "est un(e)"}]}